    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekia afikile pa myaka yakufyalwa amakumi yabili na isano (25) ilyo atendeke ukuteeka pa bufumu, kabili aikele pa bufumu mu Yerusalemu pa myaka amakumi yabili na pabula (29). Nyina ishina lyakwe ali ni Abiya umwana mwanakashi wakwa Sakaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ena acitile ifyalungama pa cinso cakwa Yawe ngefyo wishi Davidi acitile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mweshi wakubalilapo ku kutendeka kwa mwaka uwa pa bufumu bwakwe, aya isula ifiibi fya mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe no kufilungisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo aita bashimapepo na bena Levi, aisa balonganika pa lubansa lwa ku kabanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elyo abeba ati, “Umfweni kufyo ndesosa kuli imwe mwe bena Levi. Mwambilepo muisangulule mwe bene elyo musangulule ne ŋanda yakwa Yawe, Lesa wa fikolwe fyenu. Fumyenimo fyonse ifyakowela mu cifulo camushilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifikolwe fyesu fyalifililwe ukuba ne cishinka kabili bacitile ifintu ifyabipa pa cinso cakwa Yawe Lesa wesu elyo no kumusangukila. Bafutatila Yawe, bafumya ifinso fyabo ku cifulo cakwe uko ekala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baisala ne mpongolo she Tempele lyakwe, bashimya ne fisaniko. Balekele no koca ububani nangu ukutuula amalambo yakoca pa cifulo camushilo kuli Lesa wa bena Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eico Yawe alifulilwe nganshi abena Yuda na bena Yerusalemu. Abalenga ukuba icakupapako icakupeela umwenso no kusekwa ngefyo na imwe muleimwena na menso yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni pa mulandu wa ifi bacitile, eco abafyashi besu babepaile ku lupanga, kabili eco abana besu abaume na banakashi na bakashi besu babasendele muli bunkole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo nomba ndefwaya ukuti mpange icipangano na Yawe, Lesa wa bena Israeli, pakuti aleke ukutufulilwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwe bana bandi mwiba abanakuka mukubomba imilimo yenu nomba, pantu Yawe nimwe asalile ukulaba pa cinso cakwe no kulamutumika, ukulamubombela no kumocela ububani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo abena Levi abatendeke ukubomba bali nifi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cilya balonganika bamunyinabo, bonse baisangulula, elyo baingila mukusangulula iŋanda yakwa Yawe ngefyo imfumu yabakonkomeshe, ukulingana ne shiwi lyakwa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashimapepo elyo baingila mu cifulo camushilo ica mukati ka ŋanda yakwa Yawe mukuisangulula. Bafumisha panse nokubika pa lubansa lwe Tempele lyakwa Yawe fyonse ifintu ifyakowela ifyasangilwemo. Abena Levi epakusenda fyonse no kufitwala ku mukonko wa Kidironi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa bushiku bwakutendeka umweshi wantashi epo batendeke umulimo wakusangulula mpaka baya fika apakwingilila mwi Tempele lyakwa Yawe pa bushiku bwalenga cine konse konse mu mweshi wine uyo. Elyo pa nshiku na shimbi cine konse konse bakonkenyepo ukusangulula iŋanda yakwa Yawe mpaka bapwa pa bushiku ubwalenga ikumi limo na mutanda (16).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo bapwisha ukubomba imilimo, baya ku mfumu Hesekia no kuya mweba ati, “Twapwisha ukuwamya iŋanda yonse iyakwa Yawe, pamo pene no bulambo ne fibombelo fyabuko fyonse elyo ne tebulo lyakutantikapo imikate yasangululwa ne fibombelo fyaliko fyonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natusangulula no kupekanya ifibombelo fyonse filya imfumu Ahasi afumishe mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe pakukanaba ne cishinka lintu ali pa bufumu. Fyonse tufibikile pa ntanshi ya bulambo bwakwa Yawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubushiku ubwakonkelepo ulucelocelo imfumu Hesekia yasenda bacilolo ba mu musumba yaya ingila nabo mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baya leta bacilume ba ŋombe cine lubali, basukusuku cine lubali, utwana twa mpaanga utulume nato cine lubali elyo na basawe cine lubali icakufutilako pa fyabubifi fya bufumu, ifya ncende yamushilo elyo ne fya calo cine ica bena Yuda. Imfumu epakupeela icipope kuli bashimapepo aba mu lupwa lwakwa Aroni ukoca shonse inama pa bulambo bwakwa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi bashimapepo epakubuula bacilume wa ŋombe babepaya, babuula no mulopa baukana ku bulambo. Kabili babuula basukusuku babepaya, babuula no mulopa baukana ku bulambo, elyo babuula utwana twa mpaanga batwipaya nato babula umulopa watuko baukana ku bulambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo baleta basawe abakufuta pa fyabubifi apali imfumu elyo na bantu bonse pakuti babikepo iminwe yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi bashimapepo epakwipaya basawe, babuula no mulopa baushinga ku bulambo ngo mutuulo wa pa cabubifi uwakufutilako abena Israeli bonse, pantu imfumu yalibakonkomeshe ukutuula ilambo lyakoca no mutuulo wakufuta pa fyabubifi ukuti fyonse fibe pa bena Israeli bonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imfumu Hesekia epakuteka abena Levi mu fifulo fya mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe, nabekata imiwaya, amaseese ne nsango ukulingana nefyo Davidi, Gadi kamona wa mfumu elyo na Natani kasesema bafitantikilemo, umwabelele ifipope fyakwa Yawe ukupitila muli bakasesema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi ifi efyo abena Levi baiteyenye ninshi bali ne filimba fyakwa Davidi, elyo bashimapepo nabo amapenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
